    "enUS": {
      "dialogue": {
        "75df9d7118369db52951": "No doubt you are another inept simpleton sent from the Dark Lady to train under her champion.$B$B<Nathanos sighs.>$B$BI've sent every one of you back to her in pieces, I don't see why it will be any different this time.$B$BMine, however, is not to question why, but instead to do as the Dark Lady bids."
      },
      "name": "Nathanos Blightcaller",
      "subName": "Champion of the Banshee Queen",
      "translationMetadata": {
